---
pagination:
  data: sitemapBuckets
  size: 1
  alias: b
permalink: "/sitemap-{{ b.name }}.xml"
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{%- comment -%}
One child sitemap per bucket. Paginating over sitemapBuckets means .com — where
that list is empty — emits nothing at all, rather than needing a `permalink: false`
dance to suppress files it should not have.
{%- endcomment -%}
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9">
{%- include "sitemap-urls.html", bucket: b.name -%}
</urlset>
